id=vpnhide_builtin
name=VPN Hide (Built-in kernel)
version=v1.3.1
versionCode=10301
author=okhsunrog
description=Userspace companion for the in-tree (CONFIG_VPNHIDE=y) kernel backend. The driver is compiled into the kernel, so this ships no .ko — only the activator that delivers config over /proc/vpnhide_ctl. Manage targets via VPN Hide app.
